<h1>About</h1>

<p>
  Uthynauta is my personal notebook for thinking in public about
  artificial intelligence and software engineering.
</p>

<p>
  I write about LLM systems, agents, inference, observability,
  evaluation, context management, and the engineering decisions
  behind production AI systems.
</p>

<p>
  The goal is not to publish tutorials for everything, but to explore
  ideas, experiments, trade-offs, and technical questions that I find
  interesting.
</p>